docs {
  # POST /api/artworks/orders/:slug/delivery/ — Submit delivery info

  Posts the delivery form for a paid order (`paid_pending_data →
  data_complete`). Public endpoint, no `Authorization` header. Throttled:
  `artwork_orders` 60/hour (`429` when exceeded — wait and retry).

  Replace `0123456789ab` with the real order slug (same handoff as
  order-summary: copy `?order=` from the Stripe success redirect after
  paying — the fake-hex placeholder never returns 200).

  9 required fields: `receiver_name` (≤200), `receiver_phone` (≤50),
  `country` (≤100), `state` (≤100), `city` (≤100), `postal_code` (≤20),
  `neighborhood` (≤150, colonia), `street` (≤200),
  `exterior_number` (≤30). 5 optional: `interior_number` (≤30),
  `between_street_1`/`between_street_2` (≤200), `reference`,
  `delivery_notes` (all blank-allowed, default `""`).

  ## Status codes

  - `200 OK` — delivery saved (order is now `data_complete`), returns the summary
  - `400 Bad Request` — missing/invalid fields (`data` has field errors)
  - `404 Not Found` — unknown order slug
  - `409 Conflict` — order is not awaiting delivery data (e.g. form
    re-submitted — treat as success and show confirmation)
  - `429 Too Many Requests` — throttled (60 orders/hour)

  ## Response (200)

  ```json
  {
    "slug": "0123456789ab",
    "status": "data_complete",
    "currency": "mxn",
    "amount": 15000.0,
    "paid_at": "2026-09-17T12:00:00Z",
    "artwork_title": "La columna rota",
    "artwork_image": "https://enredarte-dashboard.localhost/media/artworks/columna.webp",
    "artist_name": "Frida Kahlo"
  }
  ```

  ## Error (400/404/409)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Invalid data",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```

  - `400` → `message: "Invalid data"`, `data` carries per-field errors
  - `404` → `message: "Not found."`
  - `409` → `message: "La orden no espera datos de entrega."` (treat as success)
}
